=========     current access: <currentAccess> by aicore (<secondCoreId>) type (<secondType>) block (<secondBlock>) pipe (<secondPipe>), range [0x<currentRangeBegin>, 0x<currentRangeEnd>)
=========     previous access: <previousAccess> by aicore (<firstCoreId>) type (<firstType>) block (<firstBlock>) pipe (<firstPipe>), range [0x<previousRangeBegin>, 0x<previousRangeEnd>)
=========     memory: <space><memoryOwner>, overlap [0x<overlapBegin>, 0x<overlapEnd>), <overlapBytes> bytes

